# SHUTTERBUG: proof the game can be completed without the letters: the
# demo player, told to leave U, F and O alone, flies from the title to
# King Thunderjaw and beats him: the Beacon and Saucer goals, but no
# Alien, and the ending that says what is missing.
game shutterbug
cheat letterbot 0
botuntil stage == 5 90000
expect letters == 0
botuntil state == 7 40000
expect stage == 5
expect won == 1
expect true_won == 0
expect goals & 1
expect goals & 2
expect goals !& 4
wait 300
botuntil state == 0 4000
expect save_wins == 1
expect save_trues == 0
